@host = http://localhost:5065

### health check
GET {{host}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### create a game (Classic opening position, P1 to move)
# @name createGame
POST {{host}}/api/games

### read the game back — expect 24 pieces, currentTurn "P1", moveCount 0
@gameId = {{createGame.response.body.$.id}}
GET {{host}}/api/games/{{gameId}}

### legal move — P1 slides the mirror at (2,3) to (2,4); the laser auto-fires.
### expect moveCount 1, currentTurn "P2", laserSegments ordered from the emitter.
POST {{host}}/api/games/{{gameId}}/moves
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "move", "from": { "row": 2, "col": 3 }, "to": { "row": 2, "col": 4 } }

### illegal move — not adjacent. expect 400 { "error": "..." } and moveCount unchanged.
POST {{host}}/api/games/{{gameId}}/moves
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "move", "from": { "row": 2, "col": 4 }, "to": { "row": 5, "col": 4 } }

### rotation — P1 turns the mirror at (7,2) clockwise; the laser re-fires.
POST {{host}}/api/games/{{gameId}}/moves
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "rotate", "from": { "row": 7, "col": 2 }, "rotation": "CW" }

###
